  "claim_short": "arXiv 1605.03538 Question 2.14 unbounded norm convergence un-null net increasing sequence indices without quasi-interior point. Counterexample X=ell_infinity^c(omega_1), bounded functions of countable support. Direct countable subsets C of omega_1 by inclusion, gamma_C=min(omega_1 minus C), x_C=e_gamma_C. Every fixed un-test u has countable support D and is eventually disjoint from x_C, so x_C un-converges to zero....",
